@startuml 16_Invitation_State_Machine
title Group Invitation State Machine - D08, D37

[*] --> PENDING : owner issues\n[group ACTIVE and email not an active member\nand no other PENDING for (group, email)]\n/ store SHA-256(token), expires_at = now + 7 days

PENDING --> ACCEPTED : accept\n[account ACTIVE and email matches\nand now < expires_at and group ACTIVE]\n/ create or reactivate membership
PENDING --> EXPIRED : any access or sweep\n[now >= expires_at]
PENDING --> REVOKED : owner revokes\n/ reason OWNER_REVOKED
PENDING --> REVOKED : group archived\n/ reason GROUP_ARCHIVED
PENDING --> PENDING : accept attempt by wrong account\n/ refuse, NOT consumed, audit

state ACCEPTED #palegreen {
  ACCEPTED : single use; terminal
}
state EXPIRED #lightgray
state REVOKED #pink

ACCEPTED --> [*]
EXPIRED --> [*]
REVOKED --> [*]
@enduml
